{
  "llm": {
    "enabled": true,
    "base_url": "https://openrouter.ai/api/v1",
    "model": "nvidia/nemotron-3-ultra-550b-a55b:free",
    "fallback_models": [
      "recursive/flint-v1.0:free",
      "thinkingmachines/inkling:free",
      "google/gemma-4-31b-it:free",
      "dots-studio/dots-3-note-preview:free"
    ],
    "api_key_env": "LLM_API_KEY",
    "temperature": 0.95,
    "max_tokens": 800,
    "headers": {
      "HTTP-Referer": "https://github.com/QQ38435/x-auto-ops",
      "X-Title": "x-auto-ops"
    }
  },
  "sources": {
    "github_days": 14,
    "github_keywords": ["AI skills", "agent skills", "claude skills"],
    "rss_feeds": [
      "https://www.coindesk.com/arc/outboundfeeds/rss/",
      "https://cointelegraph.com/rss",
      "https://airdrops.io/feed/"
    ],
    "search_keywords": ["AI skills", "agentic", "airdrop", "AI tools"]
  },
  "limits": {
    "daily_posts": 8,
    "daily_comments": 30,
    "daily_replies": 8,
    "per_hour": 3,
    "gap_min": 15,
    "gap_max": 60,
    "quiet_hours": [0, 8],
    "max_chars": 260,
    "post_ratio": 0.35
  },
  "templates": {
    "post": [
      "又一个 AI skill 冲上来了:{name},{stars} star。{desc} 装之前先看它跑什么命令哈。{url} 你们常驻几个?",
      "说句实话,skill 装多了真会乱。最近只留了 {name},还行。{desc} {url}",
      "这个真可以。{name} 已经 {stars} star 了,{desc} 链接放这:{url}",
      "翻到一个有点东西的:{name}。{desc} {url}",
      "刚看到 {name},{stars} star。{desc} 你们用过没?{url}"
    ],
    "comment": [
      "这个确实。{snippet}…我也踩过,后来改成小步跑才顺。",
      "哈,你说到这个我认。{snippet}…不过我更担心它乱执行命令。",
      "讲真,{snippet} 这块我也在踩坑。{name} 的思路你可以看看:{url}",
      "有道理。我这边是先把流程写死再让 agent 跑,省事不少。"
    ],
    "reply": [
      "对,我也是这么干的。先小范围试,不行就撤。",
      "嗯…看场景吧,我这边主要图省事。",
      "笑死,我也遇到过。",
      "有道理,回头试试。",
      "确实,先跑通再优化。"
    ]
  }
}
